#ASSERT `s 345(b)(1) — the annual income of another insured person` (`An insured person's assessed income for section 345` WITH `the income in the final assessment, before any exemption, deduction or credit` IS 100_000, `the contributions and equivalent tax allowed as a deduction under section 47A` IS 8_000, `the small-business deduction of section 87B applies to him` IS FALSE, `the amount allowed as a deduction under section 47(b)(1)` IS 2_000) EQUALS 90_000
#ASSERT `s 345(b)(1) — the annual income of another insured person` (`An insured person's assessed income for section 345` WITH `the income in the final assessment, before any exemption, deduction or credit` IS 100_000, `the contributions and equivalent tax allowed as a deduction under section 47A` IS 8_000, `the small-business deduction of section 87B applies to him` IS TRUE, `the amount allowed as a deduction under section 47(b)(1)` IS 2_000) EQUALS 98_000
